{"id":"n24543-1-14","stage":3,"title":"구조 · 结构","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24543-1-14-1","ko":"이거 네 글이니? 글의 구조가 미완성인 것 같은데.","zh":"这是你的文章吗？文章的结构看起来好像还没完成呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"글이니?","meaning":"文章","explanation":"글：文章；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59226","senseId":"1","lemma":"글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"글의","meaning":"文章","explanation":"글：文章；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59226","senseId":"1","lemma":"글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구조가","meaning":"结构，布局","explanation":"구조：结构，布局；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"구조","audio":"/audio/74132db92c50ae3a0a25.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24543","senseId":"1","lemma":"구조","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미완성인","meaning":"未完成，未完结","explanation":"미완성：未完成，未完结；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"미완성","audio":"/audio/e6fb4a53ab5bf19540b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56285","senseId":"1","lemma":"미완성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f77a9ef73a929938","term":"글","zh":"文章","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3","entryId":"59226","definition":"将想法或事情等用文字表达出来。","pronunciation":["글"]},{"id":"74132db92c50ae3a","term":"구조","zh":"结构，布局","audio":"/audio/74132db92c50ae3a0a25.mp3","entryId":"24543","definition":"多个部分或要素彼此相融而组成一个整体；或指那种格局。","pronunciation":["구조"]},{"id":"e6fb4a53ab5bf195","term":"미완성","zh":"未完成，未完结","audio":"/audio/e6fb4a53ab5bf19540b2.mp3","entryId":"56285","definition":"还没有完全完成。","pronunciation":["미ː완성"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd9e2ea51aa8f15956b5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24543-1-14-2","ko":"맞아. 아직 결론을 못 써서 그래.","zh":"对，因为还没写结论，所以才这样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결론을","meaning":"结论","explanation":"결론：结论；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결론","audio":"/audio/ce5da34183dc53ab86fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15966","senseId":"2","lemma":"결론","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"써서","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"ce5da34183dc53ab","term":"결론","zh":"结论","audio":"/audio/ce5da34183dc53ab86fe.mp3","entryId":"15966","definition":"对某个问题最后下的判断。","pronunciation":["결론"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写，创作","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"将头脑中的想法或感觉等用文字记在纸上而使其现出来。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4052ba4cb4b994e6cdf3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.897,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24543","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.7237,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这是你的文章吗？文章的结构看起来好像还没完成呢。","对，因为还没写结论，所以才这样。","原来丢失的钱包终于找回来了，真是太好了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是你的文章吗？文章的结构看起来好像还没完成呢。","对，因为还没写结论，所以才这样。","原来丢失的钱包终于找回来了，真是太好了。"],"answer":1}]}
